// MISTAKE: a typo in the name of an address, whose closest name is an account the words before it do not reach. `jordan` fills
// the 401(k) with `bluefin` and the IRA alone, so `jordan/bluefin/roth-ira` is no address either: what can be pasted in place
// of the typo is the address of the IRA.
base USD
use std
use us/401k
use us/ira

entity fidelity : org
entity bluefin : employer
entity jordan : person

account jordan/bluefin/401k at fidelity
account jordan/roth-ira : roth-ira at fidelity
  established 2015-01-01

opening 2026-01-01
  jordan/bluefin/401k 5_000 USD
  jordan/roth-ira 3_000 USD

2026-01-31 jordan/bluefin/roth-irc = 3_000 USD
